  "description": "Test doubles and assertion helpers for applications built on the Stratara framework — an in-memory IKeyStore, an in-memory IMessageBus, a preset ISessionContextProvider, deterministic tenant ids, and a given/when/then aggregate rehydration harness. Drop the Postgres/RabbitMQ testcontainers for unit tests.",
